- Carry joint coin and mailbox authorization in recipient addresses.
  Bind both signatures to the same network, server, output key and mailbox link.
  Supported Bitcoin destinations require no Bitcoin private-key proof.
  [#2](https://github.com/BullishNode/scuttle/pull/2)
  - **BREAKING:** New recipient addresses use delivery type 3. Legacy addresses
    remain decodable but cannot authorize new coin-only issuance.
